From: PromethenDev <PromethenDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:49:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 72/97] Vulkan: draw-time UI constant/scissor remap for reduced
 internal resolutions (WWE13 480p/576p menus)

Configured by the game (vertex-shader ucode hashes + from/to c0 pair + scene size); inactive when unset.
For matching draws only: VS c0.xy 2/(scene) -> 2/(1280,720) and the window scissor scaled from UI units to
target pixels (edges already clamped to the target extent stay full). Reviewer ACCEPT (logs/visual/reviewer-uifix.md).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
